  "body": "**Link to problem area**: any request which may return user interactive auth flow information, e.g. [here](https://spec.matrix.org/v1.2/client-server-api/#post_matrixclientv3register).\r\n\r\n**Issue**: The description of a 401 response refers to a `Flow information` type. That type is described below, but without a `<caption>` making it hard to find.\r\n\r\n![diagnosis](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/8614563/159905006-899b1d0e-e796-4129-a625-a730675b6ac0.png)\r\n\r\nCause unclear, though I wonder if the space in `Flow information` is causing trouble.\r\n\r\n",
